# 本目录直接文件说明

仅列出本目录文件；子目录内容请查看对应目录中的 `tree`。

- `import.slint` — Bill file source selection, local path preview, warning review, and explicit confirmation screen.
- `main.slint` — Top-level Slint mobile window and navigation shell.
- `pending.slint` — Pending transaction review, edit, confirm, and ignore screen.
- `reports.slint` — Confirmed-only trend, category share, merchant ranking, and refund report screen.
- `settings.slint` — Source toggles, account creation/default account, category management, and backup entry screen.
- `state.slint` — Shared Slint state, models, editor fields, and interaction callbacks.
- `theme.slint` — Shared blue and pink Slint color palette.
- `transactions.slint` — Transaction filtering/list and transaction editor screens.
- `tree` — 本目录直接文件的说明索引。
